{"id":"31b7e1fe9d49615e","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-faithful-interpretability.md","title":"Faithful Interpretability","display":"df-faithful-interpretability — Faithful Interpretability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-faithful-interpretability","aliases":["67-df-faithful-interpretability"],"display":"df-faithful-interpretability — Faithful Interpretability","depends_on":["[[67-df-interpretability]]","[[67-df-sentence]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §2，印刷页 84；PDF 第 95 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"不适用（定义）","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-faithful-interpretability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-faithful-interpretability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-faithful-interpretability — Faithful Interpretability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §2，印刷页 84；PDF 第 95 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"不适用（定义）"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是算术公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FaithInt}(S,T,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{FaithInt}(S,T,\\tau)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}T\">\\(S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}T\\)</span> 在下式定义。量化范围是源语言的全部句子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FaithInt}(S,T,\\tau)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(T\\vdash\\tau(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash\\varphi),\\\\\nS\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}T&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\tau\\ \\mathrm{FaithInt}(S,T,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FaithInt}(S,T,\\tau)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(T\\vdash\\tau(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash\\varphi),\\\\\nS\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}T&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\tau\\ \\mathrm{FaithInt}(S,T,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>忠实解释同时保持并反映可证性，因而不会把源理论的非定理变成目标理论的定理。原书 §2 的符号此处统一改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}\">\\(\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}\\)</span>。来源定义已核对，并查看 PDF 第 95 页图像。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §2，印刷页 84；PDF 第 95 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：不适用（定义）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是算术公理集；$\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FaithInt}(S,T,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}T","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FaithInt}(S,T,\\tau)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(T\\vdash\\tau(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash\\varphi),\\\\\nS\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}T&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\tau\\ \\mathrm{FaithInt}(S,T,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}","display":false}],"bytes":1551,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5c44edc6c37ffdc","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}$、$\\unlhd$ 分别取 [[67-df-faithful-interpretability]]、[[67-df-interpretability]]；标准编码与证明算术化固定为下列本册参数。"},{"id":"39ff90695df78ee1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}$ 取 [[67-df-faithful-interpretability]]，$\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-faithful-interpretability]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-faithful-interpretability]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-relative-interpretation]]；[[../67-df-faithful-interpretability]]；[[../67-lem-orey-hajek]]；[[../67-thm-orey-compactness]]；[[../67-thm-interpretability-pi1]]；[[../67-df-formula-provability]]；[[../67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]]；[[../67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration]]；[[../67-thm-faithful-interpretability-criterion]]"}],"outgoing":["44cd21d3d12e4d8d","854772391cef4007"]}